forest:['The trail leads into spider webs.','A pair of wolves wants the kill.','The quarry is a dryad\'s favorite. She is watching.','The trail crosses a goblin snare line.'],
creek:['The bank collapses under the hunter\'s weight.','A bear has claimed this stretch of water.','Snakes are sunning on every flat rock.','Stirges swarm at dusk.'],
lake:['Thin ice or soft mud swallows a hunter to the knees.','A crocodile takes interest in the hunters instead.','Fog rolls off the water and the quarry vanishes.','Lizardfolk claim these hunting grounds.'],
